📊 Interactive Dashboards (Plotly)
A collection of interactive data dashboards built with Plotly, enabling dynamic exploration and visual analysis of datasets.
These dashboards showcase responsive charting, intuitive layout design, and user-driven analytics.

📌 Features

Fully interactive Plotly visualizations

Dropdown menus, filters, and adjustable user controls

Multiple coordinated charts within a single dashboard

Clean, minimal, and analytics-focused interface

🛠 Tools Used
Python · Plotly · Pandas · NumPy · Jupyter Notebook

📁 Main File
Dashboards.ipynb — complete set of interactive dashboard implementations

